      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary heart disease can be \"silent\" but also show arrhythmias, congestion and angina. The characteristics of angina in regard to their localisation, length of time, time of occurrence, provocation and influence by drugs are described. The treatment in emergency situations is outlined."},
